    {
      "id": "RGSE",
      "code_hash": "309b931e0ba58505ce97c5651846887c",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"reuse-this-workflow\">Reuse this workflow</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">From this repository checkout, import <code>verified_dependency_query</code> from this notebook to get a plain JSON-compatible dictionary.\nUse <code>expected_release=\"26Q3\"</code> to require that release in both source datasets; a mismatch raises an error.\nThe argument checks the live release and does not select historical data.\nGene symbols and lineage names must match exactly; discovery candidates are never silently selected.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The checks compare server context membership to independently filtered metadata and compare every returned matrix ID to the requested dataset intersection.\nThey detect disagreement, missing rows, extra rows, wrong features, and non-finite values.\nThey cannot establish atomic consistency across live requests or detect an upstream omission shared by both endpoints.\nSee <code>docs/agent-readiness.md</code> in this repository for the broader task benchmark and upstream work.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    }
